## one outcome (ban), one case
tone: Danger
--- discord ---
### Don't post here
If you post here, Quack can add a case under **Honeypot**. This rule can ban you.
This channel catches spam accounts. Quack ignores posts from staff and bots.
-# 1 honeypot case so far.
