## many outcomes
tone: Danger
--- discord ---
### Don't post here
If you post here, Quack can add a case under **Honeypot**. This rule can give you a warning, time you out for 1 hour, remove you from the server, or ban you. What happens depends on how many of your cases count under it.
This channel catches spam accounts. Quack ignores posts from staff and bots.
-# 42 honeypot cases so far.
